&lt;p&gt;The premises shall be used for the following purposes as set out in the use classes order 1987:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;E(c)(i)
– Financial Services;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;E(c)(ii)
– Professional Services (other than health or medical services);&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;E(c)(iii)
- Other appropriate services in a commercial, business or service locality;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;





&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;E(g)(i)
- Offices to carry out any operational or administrative functions.&lt;font face=&quot;Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;and for no other purposes, including any other purposes within Class E of the Schedule to the Town and Country Planning (Use Classes) Order 1987 (or in any provision equivalent to that Class in any Statutory Instrument revoking and re-enacting that order with or without modification) without the prior written approval by the Local Planning Authority.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Notwithstanding to the approved plans and prior to the first occupation of the of the development hereby approved, full details of the proposed green roof and a maintenance scheme to show how the green roof would be regularly maintained shall be submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority. The
development shall be completed in accordance with the approved details and
shall thereafter be retained.&lt;/p&gt;
